; xrRazom attachment offset overrides for proxy item props.
;
; xrr_hand_offset_pos / xrr_hand_offset_rot override vanilla attach_position_offset
; / attach_angle_offset when attaching items to the player proxy. Vanilla values are
; tuned for NPC idle pose; these are tuned for the proxy's device torso clips
; (norm_torso_pda_idle_1, xrr_norm_torso_0_detector_idle_1, xrr_norm_torso_0_torchelo_idle_1, etc.).

